{"title":"2004 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 2a","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2004 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The Fryer Foundation is giving out four types of prizes, valued at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/6/2668276d1c41b9274742bfcc30aef16cee0265bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/b/dfbe8755ab50447cac8dac1ef464e9d4034f110d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"29\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/3/1b3e77d1e87399df4a1c08041805a142a9cb266c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$125$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"35\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/8/2b8219ded5e12beeb3c41192896b9fd564e3f692.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$625$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"38\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The Foundation gives out at least one of each type of prize. If five prizes are given out with a total value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/c/3cc22be4d0bb50f273e8b8fa2a289f637f77b83e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$905$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"38\" height=\"16\" />, how many of each type of prize is given out? Explain how you got your answer.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since at least one of each type of prize is given out, the amount given out for four prizes is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/a/1ead6f6beb4b91a45084547c5349a537b78c0c34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$625 + \\$125 + \\$25 + \\$5 = \\$750 + \\$30 = \\$780$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"357\" height=\"17\" />. \n</p><p>There are five prices with a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/c/3cc22be4d0bb50f273e8b8fa2a289f637f77b83e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$905$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"38\" height=\"16\" /> in value, so the fifth prize must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/b/3bb50ac5970aaaad9601cb25c033788f79528744.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$905 - \\$780 = \\$125$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"157\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, we see that there was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/8/138475c2a40854847a0e84e126c5aefa290299b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"29\" height=\"16\" /> prize, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/a/69ad9ab539eeefef70d640f950a1640d2f61eeba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"38\" height=\"16\" /> prize, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/6/726ede8365a1826a910549793ada6965126cd6f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\$125$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"47\" height=\"16\" /> prizes, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/b/e6b62ad273933bee049ad10c85374c1d5eddea3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\$625$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"47\" height=\"16\" /> price.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017203746\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.015 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 48/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 287/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2164/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.802      1 2004_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2\n100.00%    6.802      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36918:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017203746 and revision id 285713. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}